<title>USA: Texas Southern University, won by First Albany.</title>
<headline>Texas Southern University, won by First Albany.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said it won $15.090</p>
<p>million of Texas Southern University Board of Regents, Texas,</p>
<p>constitutional appropriation bonds, Series 1996, with a true</p>
<p>interest cost of 4.968 percent.</p>
</text>
